[{"target":"ielts-progressive-anchor-19","html":"<header class=\"la-heading\"><a href=\"#tests\">← 模拟</a><h1>写作模拟</h1><p hidden=\"\">当前试卷 · Cambridge IELTS 21 · Test 1</p><p class=\"sim-source-description\" hidden=\"\">Cambridge IELTS 21 Academic · Test 1。建议分别用 20 / 40 分钟，至少 150 / 250 词。</p><div class=\"question-source-meta question-source-heading\" data-source-label=\"suite-writing\"><div class=\"question-source-line\"><span class=\"question-source-kind\">剑桥真题</span><span class=\"question-source-name\">剑桥21 · Academic · Test 1</span></div><p class=\"question-difficulty\">难度系数 3–4/5 · 编辑评估</p><p class=\"question-difficulty-reason\">范围来自本套现有各Part/Passage/Task的编辑评估，不是另一个整卷分数。</p></div></header><section aria-label=\"写作选题\" class=\"sim-selection\" id=\"sim-selection-writing\"><div class=\"sim-select-heading\"><h2>这次想做哪几题？</h2><div class=\"sim-select-tools\"><button data-sim-all=\"writing\" type=\"button\">全选</button><button data-sim-clear=\"writing\" type=\"button\">清空</button></div></div><section class=\"sim-question-group\" data-sim-group=\"ux-writing-part-1\"><div class=\"sim-group-heading\"><div><h3>Task 1</h3><p class=\"sim-group-topic\">美国四行业就业：峰值、交叉与最终排名</p></div><button aria-label=\"预览Task 1题面\" data-sim-preview=\"ux-writing-part-1\" type=\"button\">预览题面</button></div><div class=\"question-source-meta question-source-group\" data-source-label=\"ux-writing-part-1\"><div class=\"question-source-line\"><span class=\"question-source-kind\">剑桥真题</span><span class=\"question-source-name\">剑桥21 · Academic · Test 1</span></div><p class=\"question-source-location\">Task 1</p><p class=\"question-difficulty\">难度系数 3/5 · 编辑评估</p><p class=\"question-difficulty-reason\">四条行业曲线跨四个年份，需选择主趋势、峰值和排名变化；单位、并列终点与对比关系要准确。</p></div><div class=\"sim-task-grid\"><label class=\"sim-task-choice\"><input aria-label=\"选择Task 1\" data-sim-part=\"ux-writing-part-1\" data-sim-question=\"writing\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"/><strong>选择 Task 1</strong></label></div></section><section class=\"s